{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32556","headline":"出门 · 刘驾","name":"出门","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出门羡他人，奔走如得涂。\n翻思他人意，与我或不殊。\n以兹聊自安，默默行九衢。\n生计逐羸马，每出似移居。\n客从我乡来，但得邻里书。\n田园几换主，梦归犹荷锄。\n进犹希万一，退复何所如。\n况今辟公道，安得不踌躇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32556.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32556","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}